        "type": "官方候选",
        "fact": "日期：2026-06-10；标题：NVIDIA Accelerates Google DeepMind’s DiffusionGemma for Local AI；原文内容：Today, Google DeepMind released DiffusionGemma — an experimental open model built for exceptionally fast text generation. NVIDIA has optimized DiffusionGemma to run even faster across NVIDIA GeForce RTX GPUs, the NVIDIA RTX PRO platform and NVIDIA DGX Spark systems, from local PCs to the cloud. Rather than generating text one word at a time, DiffusionGemma generates multiple words in parallel to output whole blocks…；来源：https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/rtx-ai-garage-local-gemma-diffusion/",
        "judgment": "这是云端从官方页面自动抓到的候选更新，需进一步研判后再升级为正式研究事件。",
        "action": "加入待研判队列",
